	"data": "Journal — 2022-10-26 00:00\n\nSummary\n\nThe speaker documents a study session on linked data principles from the Euclid Project, working through Tim Berners-Lee's [[concepts/semantic-web-and-linked-data|semantic web]] architecture and the five-star dataset rating system. They express awe at realizing they entered the field 11 years after major growth, while connecting these technical concepts to their own \"[[concepts/thought-bubbles|Thought Bubbles]]\" project and considering how IPFS might…",
